  "playbook_anchor": "Playbook \u00a72.5 'Regulatory Expectations and Public Trust' enumerates the framework's own regulatory landscape; \u00a76.6.5 commits the Council to horizon scanning against it. This file is the explicit reconciliation of that landscape onto the scanner's sources, so 'does the scanner map onto the playbook' is a checkable property rather than a thing to remember.",
